    '\n'
    "Dispatchers must give workers the absolute CLI and database paths and set `AGENTBUS_DB` for their own and their workers' commands. If the assigned bus is unwritable, report the permission failure; do not select another bus. See [sandbox grants and limitations](https://github.com/wickdninja/agentbus/blob/main/docs/sandboxed-agents.md).\n"
