    '- Finish: `post "RESULT; FILE OR COMMIT; CHECKS" --kind done`\n'
    '- Record a lasting fact: `ctx set KEY "VALUE"`\n'
    '\n'
    'Check recipients with `who`. Messages queue for absent names; posting does not start agents. Without `--to`, a message is broadcast. `--reply-to` links a message without choosing its recipient.\n'
    '\n'
    '## Read correctly\n'
    '\n'
